# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo for all text, so contributors on
# Windows/macOS/Linux and CI all see identical blobs. Prevents CRLF churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Scripts and Makefiles must be LF regardless of platform.
*.sh    text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.mk    text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
# OLE2 compound files. `* text=auto` would rewrite CRLF byte pairs anywhere in
# the stream, which for a legacy .doc shifts every offset the directory records
# and leaves a file soffice will not open.
*.doc   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
